d them and make them level up in order to become a Dragon Master\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Dragon City Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another TV Advert with the Dragon City Voiceover. Build a magical world in Dragon City! Gain hundreds of dragons, breed them and make them level up in order to become a Dragon Master.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>Great to work on another game trailer. Check out my other <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailer voiceovers</a> or my <a href=\"/lifeless-game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Lifeless Game Trailer Voiceover\">Lifeless trailer</a> and <a href=\"/worms-wmd-character-voices\" title=\"Worms WMD Trailer\">Worms WMD</a> videos if you'd like to hear more examples of my game trailer voice. It was great working with Social Point developers; they have an award winning sound engineer  who help me get the sound just right.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZtkYHKpKomM","title":"Dragon City Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/dragon-city-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Dragon City Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Dragon City Voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Who are Social Point?</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.socialpoint.es\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Socialpoint\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Socialpoint</a> is a very successful app and game development company based in Barcelona. Socialpoint is a very young, trendy company and they are making huge waves in the mobile gaming industry. The folks at Socialpoint are incredibly professional and it was especially satisfying for me to work with their expert sound team. I'm always happy to work with good clients and I fully expect to hear from Socialpoint in the future.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you have a game trailer, <a href=\"/movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer</a>, or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> that needs this voice style, then please get in touch. Always happy to audition the lines of your project first. Let's see if I'm right for your brand.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Dragon City Voiceover","pageUrl":"dragon-city-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","604",{"href":"/lego-minifigures-pirate","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bl